<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>智慧醫療互動題庫：AI / BI / CI / $</title>
  <style>
    :root { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Noto Sans TC", Arial, sans-serif; }
    body { margin: 0; padding: 24px; background: #f6f7fb; color: #111; }
    .wrap { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .progress { font-size: 13px; opacity: .8; }
    .scoreboard { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin: 12px 0 16px; }
    .pill { background: #f2f4ff; border: 1px solid #e3e7ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; }
    .pill .k { font-size: 12px; opacity: .75; }
    .pill .v { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; }

    .qTitle { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 10px 0 14px; }
    .qSub { font-size: 14px; opacity: .85; margin-top: 6px; }
    .options { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    button.opt {
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .04s ease, box-shadow .12s ease, border-color .12s ease;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    button.opt:hover { border-color: #cfd6ff; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }
    button.opt:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
    button.opt[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: not-allowed; }

    .meta { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-top: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tag { font-size: 12px; background: #f7f7f7; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }

    .analysis {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f9fbff;
      border: 1px dashed #cfd6ff;
      display: none;
    }
    .analysis h2 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .analysis p { margin: 6px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    .analysis ul { margin: 8px 0 0 18px; }
    .analysis li { margin: 6px 0; }

    .actions { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
      background: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn:hover { border-color: #cfd6ff; }
    .btn.primary { border-color: #cfd6ff; background: #f2f4ff; }
    .btn[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: not-allowed; }

    .divider { height: 1px; background: #eee; margin: 14px 0; }
    .hint { font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; margin-top: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card" role="application" aria-label="互動題目">
      <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
        <h1 style="margin:0;">智慧醫療互動題庫（AI / BI / CI / $）</h1>
        <div class="progress" id="progress">第 1 / 12 題</div>
      </div>

      <div class="scoreboard" aria-label="積分板">
        <div class="pill"><div class="k">AI</div><div class="v" id="sAI">0</div></div>
        <div class="pill"><div class="k">BI</div><div class="v" id="sBI">0</div></div>
        <div class="pill"><div class="k">CI</div><div class="v" id="sCI">0</div></div>
        <div class="pill"><div class="k">$</div><div class="v" id="sMoney">0</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="qTitle" id="qTitle"></div>
      <div class="qSub" id="qSub"></div>
      <div class="options" id="options"></div>

      <div class="meta" aria-label="狀態">
        <span class="tag" id="picked">尚未作答</span>
        <span class="tag" id="delta">尚未計分</span>
      </div>

      <div class="analysis" id="analysis" aria-live="polite">
        <h2>結果分析</h2>
        <p id="analysisText"></p>
        <ul id="analysisBullets"></ul>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn" id="prev">上一題</button>
        <button class="btn primary" id="next" disabled>下一題</button>
        <button class="btn" id="resetAll">全部重置</button>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="hint">
        規則：選項的「括號內容（積分）」不會先顯示，只有點下去才會在「結果分析」中揭露並更新 AI / BI / CI / $ 積分。<br/>
        支援負分；完成最後一題會顯示總結。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // ====== 題庫 ======
    // 你本輪提供：Level 2~8（共 7 題）
    // 再加上上一版已經有的 4 題（1~3 + Level1），總共 11 題。
    // progress 初始文字顯示 12 只是示意，會在 render 時以實際題數覆蓋。
    const QUESTIONS = [
      // ===== 基礎題 1~3 =====
